{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e42e38e3779d558677bebc756a972c4946118980c912d0f170d098faa58c8a56","ja":"ええと、次はピカソさんの代表作……。","zh":"嗯，接下来是毕加索的代表作……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2dad6a02e7efe3ddcae59481bb46649f2916b72472e65623e86d9daab1e5730f","ja":"あれ？\nセリカ、何をしているんですか？","zh":"咦？\nセリカ，你在做什么？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6c453404b3172d89ab2570105c1a4e50e9bd8968c186b4fe29208aa9025aaaac","ja":"美術のテスト勉強です。いつもよりお勉強する時間が\nとれなかったので、急いで覚えてるんですけど……。","zh":"在准备美术考试。因为没能像平时那样抽出学习的时间，\n所以正在匆忙地记……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ea94ea9be6248b90d725c6cad37d6e509f92ce8bd315fc751f031e4e4dd234dd","ja":"画家さんの名前とか、作品とか、表現や技法とか、\n難しいカタカナがいっぱいで大変です。","zh":"画家的名字、作品、表现和技法之类的，\n难记的片假名一大堆，真不容易。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"138aeeef3e48c732b1f27856ee9ae9dcbdaaa1a6d62a530585da99fea2167dc1","ja":"そういうことでしたか！　アートの世界なら、\nロコにお任せです！　レクチャーしてあげますよ♪","zh":"原来是这样啊！　说到艺术的世界，\n就交给ROCO吧！　我来给你讲解哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"997780d0ed2cce1b140211e96464f4dd677cbcd7d141866d749ed7436cc302bc","ja":"ええ、いいんですか？","zh":"咦，这样可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"276779e0cb17a921404704a91d2fe481bbaf8c0220b9e20c51e2451f8b505b53","ja":"オフコースです。美術のテストは、\n名前だけ覚えようとしてもうまくいきませんからね。","zh":"那是当然的。美术考试，\n光靠记名字是记不住的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1de4613723e6dd8c36b03167e6f9219213f7ec039f8c87e193cdc2aec4c88868","ja":"それに……ふふ、アートを語るのは、\nロコも楽しいですから♪","zh":"而且……呵呵，谈论艺术，\nROCO也很开心哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a34ae1e06c11761af1951557e7e82f1d425b910ae080b615e40c48e2e2a7a353","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、お願いします！","zh":"谢谢您！\n那么，拜托了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_957.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"403d71bedfdbdc3fd79cef3163b2459cb0caa2d31251e57a6c3fb25496dee9b0","ja":"はい！　ええと、今開いているページは……\nピカソなんですね！　では、彼のストーリーから！","zh":"好！　嗯，现在打开的页面是……\n是毕加索呢！　那就从他的故事开始吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
